<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Infaq & Donasi - Masjid Darus Sunnah</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.10.5/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body style="background-color: #FDFBF7;">

<nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg">
    <div class="container">
        <a class="navbar-brand fw-bold" href="/"><i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i> Kembali ke Beranda</a>
    </div>
</nav>

<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-6 text-center">
            <h2 class="fw-extrabold mb-3" style="color: #164230;">Infaq Digital (QRIS)</h2>
            <p class="text-muted mb-5">Salurkan infaq terbaik Anda untuk operasional dan kemakmuran Masjid Darus Sunnah melalui scan QRIS di bawah ini.</p>
            
            <div class="modern-card p-4 bg-white shadow-lg mx-auto" style="max-width: 400px; border-radius: 30px;">
                <img src="/uploads/qris-1.jpg" alt="QRIS Masjid" class="img-fluid rounded-4 mb-3" style="border: 1px solid #eee;">
                <h5 class="fw-bold mb-0">MASJID DARUS SUNNAH</h5>
                <small class="text-muted">NMID: ID1234567890</small>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-5 row g-3 text-start">
                <div class="col-12">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-4 bg-white shadow-sm">
                        <div class="bg-success bg-opacity-10 p-2 rounded-3 text-success"><i class="bi bi-1-circle-fill fs-4"></i></div>
                        <div>
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-1">Buka Aplikasi E-Wallet</h6>
                            <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Gunakan GoPay, ShopeePay, OVO, Dana, atau Mobile Banking pilihan Anda.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-12">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-4 bg-white shadow-sm">
                        <div class="bg-success bg-opacity-10 p-2 rounded-3 text-success"><i class="bi bi-2-circle-fill fs-4"></i></div>
                        <div>
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-1">Scan & Masukkan Nominal</h6>
                            <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Scan kode di atas, masukkan jumlah infaq, dan konfirmasi pembayaran.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>